5569&quot;&gt;PG connections/xacts&lt;br&gt;Cache hit ratio&lt;br&gt;Redis memory&lt;br&gt;Evictions&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;fontColor=#4C1D95;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=23;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1510" y="210" width="310" height="310" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ma-good" value="&lt;b&gt;Healthy Run&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:18px;color:#475569&quot;&gt;Throughput tracks target&lt;br&gt;Error rate remains within threshold&lt;br&gt;Queue returns to zero&lt;br&gt;No new DLQ messages&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#16A34A;fontColor=#14532D;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=25;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="650" width="500" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ma-sat" value="&lt;b&gt;Saturation Signal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:18px;color:#475569&quot;&gt;Dropped iterations increase&lt;br&gt;P95/P99 rises&lt;br&gt;CPU / connection pool reaches limit&lt;br&gt;Queue drain time increases&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;fontColor=#78350F;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=25;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="710" y="650" width="500" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ma-fail" value="&lt;b&gt;Reliability Alert&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:18px;color:#475569&quot;&gt;Outbox pending grows permanently&lt;br&gt;DLQ delta &amp;gt; 0&lt;br&gt;Worker completion stops&lt;br&gt;Readiness goes DOWN&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=18;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#E11D48;fontColor=#881337;fontFamily=DejaVu 